# OrfenPrivateRiba (29017, level 1), every draw 0: hit by the character (level 20, more than 8 above it), it
# wants the raid curse on it (4515-1, 1000000) and neither hate nor an attack desire (its hook replaces its
# parents'). Seeing the character cast Ultimate Debuff (4694) on a monster, it also wants the raid mute (4215-1)
# on it.
character Hunter 20
skill 4694 1
roll player 0
random always 0
script script.ai.individual.DefaultNpc
script script.ai.individual.Monster.MonsterAI
script script.ai.individual.Monster.WarriorBase.WarriorBase
script script.ai.individual.Monster.WarriorBase.Warrior.Warrior
script script.ai.individual.Monster.WarriorBase.Warrior.WarriorCastHoldMagic.WarriorCastHoldMagic
script script.ai.individual.Monster.WarriorBase.Warrior.WarriorCastHoldMagic.OrfenPrivateRiba
npc riba 29017 Monster 100 0 0 level 1 skill DEBUFF 4515 1 skill DEBUFF2 4215 1
npc wolf 20120 Monster 150 0 0

hit riba 10
  desires riba cast(player,4515,move)=1000000
cast wolf 4694
  S MagicSkillUse caster=player target=wolf skill=4694-1 hit=0 reuse=0 success=0
  S SystemMessage id=46 4:4694,1
  desires riba cast(player,4215,move)=1000000 cast(player,4515,move)=1000000
